    '#withDataRefreshWindowDays':: d.fn(help='"The number of days to look back to automatically refresh the data. For example, if `data_refresh_window_days = 10`, then every day BigQuery reingests data for [today-10, today-1], rather than ingesting data for just [today-1]. Only valid if the data source supports the feature. Set the value to 0 to use the default value."', args=[d.arg(name='dataRefreshWindowDays', type=d.T.integer)]),
